1.0 Frontend Documentation
The front end gadget store application provides the user interface for customers to browse electronical products, 
view details about then and complete purchases. It communicates with the backend API to retrieve and display data.

2.0 Technologies used
TypeScript
React
Node js

3.0 Installation and Setup
cd frontend
pnpm install

Troubleshooting Build Script
if there is an error like this: ERR_PNPM_IGNORED_BUILDS] Ignored build scripts: sharp@0.34.5, unrs-resolver@1.11.1
try pnpm approve-builds

Start frontend server
pnpm start
Server local network: http://localhost:3000
server network: http://192.168.56.1:3000

then open on your browser the Server local network

